<view class="page checkout-page"><view class="checkout-title">确认订单</view><view class="checkout-subtitle">购买会员 · 手动续费</view>
  <view class="checkout-card plan-summary"><view class="summary-title">{{plan.name || '会员套餐'}}</view><view class="summary-price">¥{{payableText}}</view><view class="summary-line">有效 {{plan.durationDays || '-'}} 天</view><view class="summary-line">发放至：{{family.name || '当前家庭'}}</view></view>
  <view class="checkout-card"><view class="card-title">本次购买包含</view><view class="check-line">✓ {{plan.membershipTier === 'unlimited' ? '快速记录不限次数' : '快速记录 30 次/月'}}</view><view class="check-line">✓ 更多家庭成员与附件额度</view><view class="check-line">✓ 会员有效期按当前到期时间顺延</view></view>
  <view class="checkout-card payment-card"><view class="card-title">支付方式</view><view class="payment-row"><text>官方小程序虚拟支付</text><text class="payment-status">已开通</text></view></view>
  <view class="checkout-card coupon-card"><view class="card-title">优惠券</view><view wx:if="{{coupon}}" class="selected-coupon"><view><view class="coupon-name">{{coupon.name}}</view><view class="coupon-detail">{{coupon.discountPreview || '已选择优惠券'}}</view></view><text bindtap="clearCoupon">移除</text></view><view wx:else class="coupon-row" bindtap="chooseCoupon"><text>未使用优惠券</text><text class="coupon-link">选择优惠券 ›</text></view></view>
  <view class="price-card"><view><text>商品金额</text><text>¥{{originalText}}</text></view><view><text>优惠减免</text><text class="discount">-¥{{discountText}}</text></view><view class="payable"><text>应付金额</text><text>¥{{payableText}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="warning-card">购买前请确认：会员套餐属于虚拟服务，支付完成后不支持退款；本次为手动购买，不会自动续费或自动扣款。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{paymentMessage}}" class="payment-message">{{paymentMessage}}</view>
  <button class="confirm-button" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="confirmPayment">确认支付 ¥{{payableText}}</button>
</view>
